{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "gymbro-chat-api-collection",
    "name": "GymBro chat-api",
    "description": "Colección del servicio **chat-api** (`:3010`), no de Nest.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Importá esta colección **y** `GymBro.api.postman_collection.json` + `GymBro.local.postman_environment.json`.\n2. Environment **GymBro Local** (el `accessToken` lo llena el Login Staff de la colección API).\n3. `chatApiUrl` default: `http://localhost:3010`.\n\nStaff: JWT del environment. Landing: `POST /v1/public/session` (sin auth). JWT Member/Super: 403. DELETE archiva el hilo.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "if (!pm.environment.get('chatApiUrl') && !pm.collectionVariables.get('chatApiUrl')) {",
          "  pm.collectionVariables.set('chatApiUrl', 'http://localhost:3010');",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "chatApiUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3010"
    },
    {
      "key": "createdConversationId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "GET health",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('database up', () => pm.expect(body.database).to.eql('up'));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{chatApiUrl}}/health"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Public POST session",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('token', () => pm.expect(body.token).to.be.a('string'));",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('publicChatToken', body.token);",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('publicConversationId', body.conversation.id);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{chatApiUrl}}/v1/public/session"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Staff GET conversations",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('items array', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().items).to.be.an('array'));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{chatApiUrl}}/v1/conversations",
          "host": ["{{chatApiUrl}}"],
          "path": ["v1", "conversations"],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "archived",
              "value": "true",
              "disabled": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "Lista hilos del staff. archived=true → solo archivados."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Staff POST conversation",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
              "const j = pm.response.json();",
              "if (j.id) {",
              "  pm.collectionVariables.set('createdConversationId', j.id);",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Prueba C2\"\n}"
        },
        "url": "{{chatApiUrl}}/v1/conversations"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Staff GET conversation",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{chatApiUrl}}/v1/conversations/{{createdConversationId}}"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Staff PATCH conversation",
      "request": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Hilo renombrado\"\n}"
        },
        "url": "{{chatApiUrl}}/v1/conversations/{{createdConversationId}}"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Staff DELETE conversation (archive)",
      "request": {
        "method": "DELETE",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{chatApiUrl}}/v1/conversations/{{createdConversationId}}",
        "description": "Archiva (archivedAt). El hilo deja de listarse en GET sin archived=true."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Staff POST message (stream)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "text/event-stream"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"text\": \"¿Tenemos un afiliado Socio?\"\n}"
        },
        "url": "{{chatApiUrl}}/v1/conversations/{{createdConversationId}}/messages",
        "description": "C4: UI Message Stream. Requiere OPENROUTER_API_KEY real y mcp arriba. Postman muestra SSE; el historial se lee con GET messages."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Staff GET messages",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('items array', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().items).to.be.an('array'));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{chatApiUrl}}/v1/conversations/{{createdConversationId}}/messages",
        "description": "Historial persistido (user / assistant / tool). Aislado por tenant+user."
      }
    }
  ]
}
